{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TicqdxUDmqZ5hrhWbLPrhe","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Team Implementation Log\n2\t\n3\t## Run Overview\n4\t- State: STORY_ACTIVE\n5\t- Spec Pack Root: /Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core\n6\t- Current Story: 00-foundation\n7\t- Current Phase: implement (story-orchestrate run driving implement->self-review->verify)\n8\t- Last Completed Checkpoint: story-orchestrate validate => ready (artifacts/00-foundation/001-story-validate.json); run launched in background\n9\t\n10\t## Setup Outcome (2026-06-14)\n11\t- preflight => ready. Artifact: artifacts/preflight/001-preflight.json\n12\t- Provider matrix: primary claude-code available + authenticated (claude.ai, max sub, liminal.builder@gmail.com); secondary codex available (codex-cli 0.139.0), authStatus UNKNOWN (no non-mutating check) — preflight advised proceed if CLI works. WATCH: codex-backed roles (story_lead_provider, story_verifier, quick_fixer) will fail if codex is not logged in; implementor is Claude-backed so implementation itself is unaffected.\n13\t- verification_gates persisted into impl-run.config.json by preflight (expected side effect).\n14\t- Prompt assets ready; no blockers.\n15\t\n16\t## Run Configuration\n17\t- Primary Harness: claude-code\n18\t- Story Lead Provider: codex / gpt-5.5 / high\n19\t- Story Implementor: none (claude) / claude-opus-4-8 / max\n20\t- Quick Fixer: codex / gpt-5.5 / medium\n21\t- Story Verifier: codex / gpt-5.5 / xhigh\n22\t- Self Review Passes: 3\n23\t- Epic Reviewer 1: none (claude) / claude-opus-4-8 / max\n24\t- Epic Reviewer 2: codex / gpt-5.5 / high\n25\t- Epic Reverifier: none (claude) / claude-opus-4-8[1m] / max\n26\t- Degraded Diversity: false (codex secondary harness available at /opt/homebrew/bin/codex)\n27\t\n28\t## Verification Gates\n29\t- Story Gate: pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify\n30\t- Story Gate Source: explicit CLI flag (preflight --story-gate); persisted to impl-run.config.json\n31\t- Epic Gate: pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify-all\n32\t- Epic Gate Source: explicit CLI flag (preflight --epic-gate); persisted to impl-run.config.json\n33\t- Gate Discovery Rationale: pi-lhc/package.json has no scripts yet (Story 0 creates them), so package-script discovery is empty pre-Story-0. Gate composition mirrors the lhc package (verified): verify = build+typecheck+lint+boundaries+vitest; green-verify = verify + check-test-immutability; verify-all = verify. Per ls-impl setup guidance, story gate = `verify` is preferred over `green-verify` because green-verify's check-test-immutability guard would trip on stories that legitimately add tests. Story files name green-verify (S1-S6) / red-verify (S0) per-story; run-level orchestration uses one uniform story gate (`verify`), which is a strict superset of red-verify and avoids the immutability-guard conflict. Epic gate = verify-all (== verify in this package).\n34\t\n35\t## Story Sequence\n36\t- 00-foundation\n37\t- 01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution\n38\t- 02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation\n39\t- 03-capture-verification\n40\t- 04-fork-as-new-thread\n41\t- 05-inference-host-routing\n42\t- 06-startup-validation-and-assignment-config\n43\t\n44\t## Current Continuation Handles\n45\t- Story Implementor:\n46\t  - Story: none\n47\t  - Provider: none\n48\t  - Session ID: none\n49\t  - Result Artifact: none\n50\t- Story Verifier:\n51\t  - Story: none\n52\t  - Provider: none\n53\t  - Session ID: none\n54\t  - Result Artifact: none\n55\t\n56\t## Story Receipts\n57\t(none yet)\n58\t\n59\t## Cumulative Baselines\n60\t- Baseline metric: count of workspace test FILES matching `\\.(test|spec)\\.[cm]?[jt]sx?$` (the runtime's regression metric, from validate baselineSeed) — NOT pi-lhc test-case count.\n61\t- Baseline Before Current Story (00-foundation): 375 (workspace test files, per story-orchestrate validate baselineSeed 2026-06-14)\n62\t- Expected After Current Story: